# Event GH Quality Gates

## Required Verification
- Every behavior change needs automated test coverage (new test or test update).
- Run the minimum relevant test scope first (`php artisan test --compact --filter=...`), then broaden if needed.

## Language-Specific Checks
- For PHP changes: run `vendor/bin/pint --dirty --format agent`.
- For JS/TS changes: use `npm run lint`, `npm run format`, and `npm run types:check` when relevant.

## Build and Runtime Sanity
- If frontend assets appear stale, run `npm run dev`, `npm run build`, or `composer run dev`.
- Keep fixes aligned with existing architecture and avoid unrelated refactors during feature work.
